{"channelId":"UC9ZY6py-WxySxsoPv9Sqzdw","row":["DCH Animal Adoptions",298,"About DCH\n\nDCH Animal Adoptions, which stands for \"dogs, cats and horses\", is a NSW-based non-profit animal rescue charity (CFN 18284) committed to the rescue and rehoming of unwanted and neglected domestic animals - mainly dogs, cats and horses - but occasionally other animals such as rabbits and guinea pigs.\nOur volunteers rescue animals from certain death in Sydney's pounds and shelters, and horses from the knackery and ensure they are provided with veterinary attention and foster care until a permanent and loving home can be found.\nThe foster care system benefits you and the foster pet. By providing you with valuable information about the animal gained through the carer's experiences in a home environment, we can help match you up with the right pet for your home. The animals also benefit from being in a loving home environment until their permanent homes are found.","enquiries@dchanimaladoptions.com.au; webdesign@hanusi.com","Australia"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC9ZY6py-WxySxsoPv9Sqzdw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC9ZY6py-WxySxsoPv9Sqzdw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:04.095Z","channelId":"UC9ZY6py-WxySxsoPv9Sqzdw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"f3735e1d621a2391c2dd5ad4d425c6d410eee94b2b0bce6ed47cc9e30b482f3f","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"dc5ff7757592d30c23fc2d3fd1699352173a97adc23a3c709c2e86842b3c72d9"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC9ZY6py-WxySxsoPv9Sqzdw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:02:03.868Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC9ZY6py-WxySxsoPv9Sqzdw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":298,"raw":"298 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC9ZY6py-WxySxsoPv9Sqzdw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:04.095Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"enquiries@dchanimaladoptions.com.au